/// Absolute path to the root of your clone of this repository, with no trailing slash. Every
/// mart query builds its own file path from this one parameter, so a reviewer changes exactly
/// one value after cloning. Committed empty on purpose: an absolute path from one machine does
/// not belong in a public repository.
expression RepoRoot = "" meta [IsParameterQuery=true, Type="Text", IsParameterQueryRequired=true]
